0..74 Comment "// The circle\'s loop space as a group, after the group-law half of cubical"
75..151 Comment "// Agda\'s `Cubical/HITs/S1/Base.agda`: spinning as a map of sums, winding as"
152..221 Comment "// one, and the loops commuting. `circle.gandr` holds the equivalence"
222..297 Comment "// `winding` these laws read through; this source restates the declarations"
298..374 Comment "// it uses, as every corpus source does. `int-sum.gandr` holds the integers\'"
375..452 Comment "// sum and its laws, and `circle-rotation.gandr` the circle\'s multiplication."
453..531 Comment "// Where cubical fills a cube by `hcomp`, a law here is conversion on words or"
532..542 Comment "// `cong`."
543..545 Comment "//"
546..629 Comment "// Out of reach by design: `ΩS¹≡ℤ`, the loops equal to the integers as types,"
630..705 Comment "// needs univalence; `isSetΩS¹` and `toPropElim` need the h-level ladder;"
706..779 Comment "// `basedΩS¹ x ≡ ℤ` at every point needs equivalences as structure."
